### ==========================================================
### GET - MOSTRAR ADMINISTRADORES
### ==========================================================

### Mostrar administradores (super admin) -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/administradores
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenSuper}}

### Mostrar administradores (admin normal) -> 403
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/administradores
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenNormal}}

### Mostrar administradores (sin token) -> 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/administradores

### ==========================================================
### POST - CREAR ADMINISTRADOR
### ==========================================================

### Crear administrador correcto -> 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/administradores
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenSuper}}

{
  "nombre": "Carlos",
  "apellidoPaterno": "Quispe",
  "apellidoMaterno": "Mamani",
  "ci": "9876543",
  "telefono": "78945612",
  "email": "carlos.quispe@gmail.com"
}

