### ==========================================================
### DELETE - DAR DE BAJA (baja lógica: estado = 'Inactivo')
### ==========================================================

### Dar de baja administrador -> 200
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/admin/administradores/2
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenSuper}}

### Dar de baja al super administrador (id 1) -> 403
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/admin/administradores/1
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenSuper}}

### Dar de baja administrador inexistente -> 404
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/admin/administradores/99999
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenSuper}}

### Dar de baja (admin normal) -> 403
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/admin/administradores/2
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenNormal}}

### Dar de baja (sin token) -> 401
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/admin/administradores/2

### ==========================================================
### PUT - ACTIVAR ADMINISTRADOR (estado = 'Activo')
### ==========================================================

### Activar administrador -> 200
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/administradores/2/activar
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenSuper}}

### Activar administrador inexistente -> 404
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/administradores/99999/activar
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenSuper}}

### Activar (admin normal) -> 403
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/administradores/2/activar
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenNormal}}

### Activar (sin token) -> 401
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/administradores/2/activar

